# Code owners for kerkit.
#
# Every path currently resolves to the sole maintainer. When a second
# maintainer / recovery owner is added to the @kerkit npm org (see RELEASING.md
# "Access & recovery"), add them here so review and release ownership are shared
# in more than one place.
#
# GitHub requests review from these owners automatically. It does NOT enforce
# their approval unless branch protection requires review from Code Owners —
# see the manual branch-protection step in RELEASING.md.

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
*                       @JuanseHevia

# Release-critical surface: publish workflow, release runbook, changeset config,
# and package manifests. Changes here can alter what/how we publish.
/.github/workflows/     @JuanseHevia
/.changeset/            @JuanseHevia
/RELEASING.md           @JuanseHevia
/scripts/               @JuanseHevia
/packages/*/package.json @JuanseHevia
